Anylinux AppImage Runtime and Loader Notices
=============================================

This AppImage embeds the pinned runtime and loader components below.
Build-host-only packaging tools (`quick-sharun.sh` @ `9ed54a2c6213cf7f72993bd25635a655be78516e`,
`appimagetool` 0.7.0, and `mkdwarfs` 0.15.6) run only during image creation and are
not included in the distributed AppImage. Shared libraries, plugins, helper binaries,
and data assets staged into the AppDir from the Arch Linux build container are
recorded in `AppImage-bundled-packages.txt` and retain their respective upstream
licenses.


